# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Order (0.4.3 fix round): Donova's camp in western Winterspring (Gregan's elixir for The Videre Elixir, the
# Frostfire furbolgs at 53-55) and Felpaw Village's cauldron on the way out by Talonbranch Glade; Ratchet and
# Gadgetzan (Gaeriyan's grave), Un'Goro Crater's second visit (Linken and J.D. Collie, the pylons, the expedition,
# Torwa, Krakle and Ringo) at about 53-54, Gadgetzan's and Ratchet's hand-ins on the way out, then Felwood's south (Greta's
# corruption, Eridan's vial and Linken's memory, Arko'narin and Shadow Hold) and Winterspring's main loop (Donova,
# the furbolg runners, Kel'Theril, Starfall and Mazthoril) at about 54-55, ending in
# Moonglade. All of it used to wait for the Western Plaguelands and Silithus guides at 56.6-59.7, while this guide
# opened on a top-up from 53.6 to 55 at Frostfire Hot Springs.
# Left out: Pawn Captures Queen (4507: Gorishi Hive Queen 56 in the Slithering Scar, and no Gadgetzan stop after it on
# the route), Strange Sources (4842: its point is at Darkwhisper Gorge's mouth among elite Frostmaul giants and
# Hederine), Ancient Spirit (4261: Kayneth's hand-in at Forest Song is south of the route once Felwood is done), Silver
# Heart (4084: the Irontree Stompers are north of the route's last Emerald Sanctuary stop), Are We There, Yeti? part 3
# (5163: its scares are in Gadgetzan and Un'Goro, behind the route), A Reliquary of Purity (5527: level 56, and
# Rabine's hand-in needs another Moonglade trip after Silithus), Find Ranshalla (979: Erelas gives it for the
# feathers on the Plaguelands guide's way through Rut'theran, after Winterspring), Winterfall Activity (8464, Salfa's
# furbolg village east of Everlook: Ursa 57-58 and Shaman 56-57, two or more levels over the route there; with its
# follow-up 8469, the Winterfall Spirit Beads) and Jaron's Supplies (4864: the amulet drops from the owlbeasts around
# Jaron's wagon, 56-59).

