step The road west: feathers, furs and horns
  zone Winterspring
  tip Moontouched Feathers lie on the ground all along the road west to Donova, where the Ragged Owlbeasts (53) roam: pick them up as you ride.
  tip The same road crosses the Rogue Ice Thistles' ground (about one in three drops a Thick Yeti Fur for Umi) and the Fledgling Chillwinds' (about one in five drops an Uncracked Chillwind Horn for Felnok): work both here, around the road's middle.
  tip Careful: both are 53-55: pull the lower ones and take them one at a time.
