step Frostfire Hot Springs: kill these as you meet them
  zone Winterspring
  tip The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Donova and the tunnel. Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need): right-click it. They also drop Winterfall Ritual Totems (about one in thirty) and Runecloth, which only matter if you are Neutral (the totem) or Friendly (Meilosh's Runecloth) with the Timbermaw: keep them then.
  tip Careful: the Pathfinders are 53 and the Totemics 54, but the Den Watchers inside the camp are 55: take the camp from its edge and pull one at a time.
  collect 12771                       -- Empty Firewater Flask
  accept 5083
  kill 7442 quest 5082.1              -- Winterfall Pathfinder
  kill 7440 quest 5082.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7441 quest 5082.3              -- Winterfall Totemic
  collect 14047 x30 optional          -- Runecloth, for Meilosh, if you are Friendly with the Timbermaw

