step Shadow Hold braziers
  tip Shadow Hold is the cave at the back of Jaedenar, west of the road. Use the Purified Moonwell Water on the four braziers inside.
  tip Careful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns: pull at the edge of each group and fight one pack at a time.
  tip The Jaedenar Darkweavers, Warlocks and Enforcers in here drop a Blood Red Key, about one kill in thirty: keep killing them until it drops. It opens the cell of Arko'narin, the night elf held in the cave.
