# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Moonglade

step Sindrayl
  zone Moonglade
  tip Ride back north up the valley and west along the road to the tunnel at Winterspring's western end, where Salfa stands. Walk into Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel down to Moonglade. Sindrayl, Moonglade's flight master, stands south of the lake, outside Nighthaven: learn the flight path from him. The flight master in Nighthaven itself flies only Druids, from her gossip, and has no flight path to learn. The next guide flies on from here.
  getfp "Moonglade"
